{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呐，新吾。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1771", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小乾那样没问题吗？”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1772", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她用像跟饲主分开的小狗的眼神在看这边喔。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1773", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4812", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一跟我对上视线就脸红了。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "戒断症状。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "交往得越久，在教室里装不认识就越痛苦。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也一样。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以下课时间我经常把纱凪带出教室，去没有人的地方独处。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了缓和她的戒断症状。……而且我也无法忍耐了。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为接吻的话纱凪就会腿软站不起来，所以我们很克制……", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，彼此都快到极限了。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然了，我跟纱凪的“极限”还是有一点差距的。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我们的确需要想想办法。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个样子，被注意到只是时间的问题。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1774", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想也是。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，是做了什么才会让小乾变成那样？”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1775", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱的力量？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哈，一脸正经地说喔。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1776", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过啊，对象是你的话变成那样也能理解。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1777", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小乾偏偏是选到了你，嗯。”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1778", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们在教室的角落小声说话，此时有几个女生朝我们走来。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，瓜生君可以聊一下吗？”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0010", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，嗯。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不在这里比较好吧？”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1779", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，反正是椋梨君嘛。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0011", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那是什么意思？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1780", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔呼呼♪”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0012", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我原本以为是什么严重的事，但女生们的心情都很好的样子。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该不用这么紧张吧。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们想说什么？”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，那个啊，瓜生君其实有在交往的人吧？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0013", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我之前在假日的时候……看到瓜生君跟一个短发的女孩子走在一起……”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0014", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们之间的气氛那么好，应该不是朋友吧？那个短发的女孩子……”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0015", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸～真的假的！瓜生君，你在跟谁交往吗？！”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_jx0002", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂喂，真的假的啊瓜生～是这所学园的女生吗？哪一班的？”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "_dc0001", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃那个……”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一下子变成班上的注目焦点，这下感觉很难糊弄过去了。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4813", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪也担心地看着我。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～那个，其实啊……”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1781", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，隼太。谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我拦下正要帮我转移话题的隼太，静静地看了纱凪一眼。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4814", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在的我们不需要话语。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我懂纱凪的不安。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我朝她点点头，纱凪也回应了。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我抬头挺胸走向纱凪。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然这不是什么需要宣布的事情。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4815", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事的。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我站在纱凪身边，握住她的手。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我跟乾同学……跟纱凪交往了。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "_GO_047", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室瞬间安静下来，所有人都看着我们。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪有点害怕，甚至把我的手握到痛了。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太和濑名同学都在远处看着我们。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……很行嘛瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_ar6605", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那家伙是关键时刻会挺身而出的人喔。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1782", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是朋友的话，至少拍个手祝福吧？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_ar6606", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉没有那个必要了。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1783", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……也对。”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_ar6607", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸──！？骗人！是乾同学吗！？”“什么──！？居然是乾同学！？”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "_GO_048", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "几乎撼动整间教室的惊呼声。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“讨厌，未免太适合了吧！”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0018", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的假的！？好好喔～纱凪好好喔～～～！”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_jx0005", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可恶，我也想追乾同学啊！可是跟瓜生比一定输嘛──！”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "_dc0004", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……欸？欸？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4816", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一句接着一句的祝福朝我们涌来，纱凪困惑地看了我一眼。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，那个短发的女孩是乾同学啊！真的好可爱我吓了一跳！”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0019", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来最近纱凪变得很漂亮呢～”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_jx0006", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可恶可恶可恶，算了！瓜生，恭喜啊！我是参加奖！”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 303, "voice": "_dc0005", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好羡慕乾同学～”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 341, "voice": "_jz0020", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，我也想谈恋爱……想谈火辣辣烧烫烫的热恋！”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 342, "voice": "_jx0007", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……呃……谢、谢……大家……”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4817", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢大家。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们低下头，同学们又起哄了一番。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，为什么……”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4818", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有什么奇怪的？”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_ar6608", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为我……之前说了那么多新吾的坏话……现在却……”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4819", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_ar6609", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学笑了笑，捏了一把纱凪的脸。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在大家的眼中看来，就是这样的两人啊。现在的纱凪和瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_ar6610", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是这样。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "_ht1784", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀哎呀，在聊什么话题这么热闹呢？”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_ag3988", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁从天花板上冒出来，大家顿时安静了下来。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁，你太不会气氛了！”“安洁，你也太不会看气氛了吧！”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "全班同学", "alt_speaker_idx": 301, "voice": "_GO_049", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸欸、欸欸欸欸！？”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 306, "voice": "_ag3989", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4820", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪看着我笑了，她摆荡着交握的手。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“最后锋头都被安洁抢走了。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这不是很好吗？很有我们的风格。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4821", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……谢谢你喔，新吾。”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "_sn4822", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我才是，谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 326, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "简短的道谢中隐含了各种意思。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我希望永远都不要忘记这个心情。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管交往了多久。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许今后我们会吵架。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是不要忘记感谢的心情。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望我们两人都能像现在这样。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
